                <pb facs="2292" n="2187" xml:id="pg2187"/>


                <head>Note From Gray to Lay</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1960-11-25">November 25,
                        1960</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d606-3" n="3" type="facsimile" xml:id="d606-3"/>
                <p>Mr. Lay:</p>
                <p>I agree with Mr. Gates that there should be a single document setting forth the
                    U.S. Arms Control Policy. You will recall that we had such a codification
                    project on the books many months ago.</p>
                <p>I think we should give every possible impetus to this.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gordon Gray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
